\paragraph{Cross-Architecture Validation.}
\label{sec:cross_arch}
Table~\ref{tab:cross_arch} evaluates on Mistral-7B-v0.3~\cite{jiang2023mistral} (GQA + sliding window, dense PPL 5.52).

\begin{table}[t]
